{
  "_meta": {
    "category": "attributes",
    "description": "Per-row OLS fitted values and residuals on customers.pulse (target income, predictors [age]) via ATTR_REG_FITTED and ATTR_REG_RESIDUAL: REG_FITTED emits hat(y_i) = X_i . beta + beta_0 per row, REG_RESIDUAL y_i - hat(y_i). Later slots can read either derived field without re-fitting, e.g. ATTR_ZSCORE on the residual to surface outliers.",
